ads.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd0d803fdaed82b8319f203fa58360a3dd3f3ccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/cd0d803fdaed82b8319f203fa58360a3dd3f3ccf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/c95a9788201b2cb7f818aae1789ab8158541d464","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/c95a9788201b2cb7f818aae1789ab8158541d464","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGM5NWE5Nzg4MjAxYjJjYjdmODE4YWFlMTc4OWFiODE1ODU0MWQ0NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e","sha":"d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e"}],"sha":"c95a9788201b2cb7f818aae1789ab8158541d464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c95a9788201b2cb7f818aae1789ab8158541d464"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T16:06:26Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T16:06:36Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(devide-bc-dialog): make role column editable like name\n\nThe role cell was rendered as plain {{ item.role }} text while the\nsurrounding columns (name, importance, implementationStrategy) all had\ninline editors. Wrap role in v-edit-dialog with a v-text-field bound to\neditedFields.role, register the role key on editedFields, and add a\nsaveItemEdit ''role'' case that copies the edited value back onto the\nunderlying boundedContext (and item, so the v-data-table cell reflects\nit immediately). initializeEditFields / cancelEdit now also seed\neditedFields.role from the current value. Same change applied to the\nduplicated single-result and tabs templates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"413cd37fd80353e731cfc18b95bc59650cfc14e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/413cd37fd80353e731cfc18b95bc59650cfc14e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGQ1MTNiMWM4YWEwMjY0NTQ0ZDIyY2U4ZmIxYTc2MDFmZmEyZWQzM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df","sha":"e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df"}],"sha":"d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/d513b1c8aa0264544d22ce8fb1a7601ffa2ed33e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T11:57:00Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T11:57:09Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(proxies): clean up watch listeners on AggregateDraft / Traceability / PreviewFields\n\nExtends the watcher cleanup pattern (already applied to LangGraphProxyBase\nin b9f5464a) to three custom proxies that do not inherit from it. Each\nwatchJob registered 7-9 acebase listeners and never tore them down on\ncompletion/failure, so listeners accumulated across iterative bounded\ncontext / preview / trace generations and fired the same callbacks N\ntimes after reconnects.\n\nFor each proxy:\n- jobState gets _watchedPaths Set + _watchersCleaned flag\n- _trackWatch(path) registers each watched path\n- _cleanupWatchers iterates the Set and calls storage.watch_off bulk\n- isCompleted (via parseState) and isFailed branches each invoke\n  cleanup; the flag keeps it idempotent\n\nIn AggregateDraft this also replaces the single unwatchCompleted handle\nwith a sweep over all listeners so logs / inference / progress /\noptions / error / boundedContext are released too, not just isCompleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec897feceb7bec77b9e13455f81c66d624932098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/ec897feceb7bec77b9e13455f81c66d624932098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGUzYzI2ZGI4NWU0Y2Q3MWVjYWRjNzc4MDVkNDNjYmEwM2U3NDcwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e","sha":"0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e"}],"sha":"e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/e3c26db85e4cd71ecadc77805d43cba03e7470df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T07:18:50Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T07:23:54Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(modelcanvas): write userLists/mine directly on save to bypass unreliable trigger\n\nThe acebase server-side mutated trigger (acebase/main.js) is what\npopulates userLists/{author}/mine on definitions/{id}/information\nwrites. Unlike Firebase Cloud Functions, this trigger is an in-process\n.on(\"mutated\").subscribe() with a silent try/catch and a 10s\ninitialization grace window, so failures are invisible and unretried.\nES model saves were landing in definitions/* with the right author but\nthe trigger was not firing reliably for that path, leaving the model\nout of the Mine/Share/Public listings even though it exists in DB.\n\nsetForkData has long written userLists/.../mine directly from the\nclient (line 2081), which is why forked models always show up. Apply\nthe same pattern to saveModel — putObject is a merge update so it stays\nidempotent if the server trigger does fire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c49997d34b7da37c075a7fb1cc264c500adfe230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/c49997d34b7da37c075a7fb1cc264c500adfe230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDBhZDZkZDczMmZkMzE2ZmJhNjZkOWIzZmZhODVhMWM5ODU4MmNiM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77","sha":"c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77"}],"sha":"0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/0ad6dd732fd316fba66d9b3ffa85a1c98582cb3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T06:45:03Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T06:45:45Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(acebase): drop child_objects=false on userLists list reads\n\nThe Mine / Share / Public tabs all go through _list on userLists/*\npaths. The previous optimization (child_objects=false) excluded nested\nobjects from each child, but the server side has two triggers that fill\nthose nodes:\n\n  - acebase/main.js:173 (Trigger 1) writes top-level scalars under\n    userLists/{uid}/{mine|share|share_first|share_{type}}/{projectId}.\n  - acebase/main.js:293 (Trigger 2) writes the same fields one level\n    deeper under userLists/{uid}/mine/{projectId}/information.\n\nWhen Trigger 1 silently bails — e.g., the beforeInformation\nReferenceError on line 241 hit by the empty catch on line 254, or the\n10s INITIALIZATION_DURATION grace window — only Trigger 2''s nested\npayload exists. child_objects=false then strips that payload, the\nclient receives data[projectId] = {}, setListByAcebase''s `item.type`\nfilter drops it, and the saved ES model is invisible across all\nlistings even though the underlying definitions/{id}/information node\nis intact.\n\nuserLists payloads are small, so just read the whole subtree. Tabs\nbecome tolerant to either trigger firing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a1cb008cfe05200ec35f321893069b31008adfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/5a1cb008cfe05200ec35f321893069b31008adfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGM4N2MyYWZlNTY1MDFlZTI2MGY4YmQxZTNjMzQwNjYyZTUxMDlhNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f","sha":"230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f"}],"sha":"c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c87c2afe56501ee260f8bd1e3c340662e5109a77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T06:09:35Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T06:09:44Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(esdialoger): drop child debounce on update:draft — let parent coalesce\n\nThe 300ms debounce on triggerDraftEmit was not wired into the parent''s\nflush chain (AutoModelingDialog._flushDraftSave only flushes its own\ndebounces). A short workflow followed by a quick navigation could leave\nthe pending emit unsent, so the parent never saw the latest messages\nand skipped saving entirely.\n\nAutoModelingDialog.updateDraft already coalesces acebase writes with an\n800ms debounce that IS flushed on beforeRouteLeave / beforeDestroy /\nbeforeUnload. Adding another debounce on the child was an over-\noptimization that broke data integrity; the emit itself is cheap.\n\nReplace the body of triggerDraftEmit with a direct synchronous \\$emit so\nevery call reaches the parent immediately and no pending state can be\nlost on teardown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f193ad2ace63a6f54e431f3df37e261e6c427c14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/f193ad2ace63a6f54e431f3df37e261e6c427c14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDIzMGUyZmI2YjgzN2VkMThkMDg5OTI1MmVkN2MxYjNiOGNiNjE4MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52","sha":"64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52"}],"sha":"230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/230e2fb6b837ed18d0899252ed7c1b3b8cb6181f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T05:59:24Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T05:59:33Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(esdialoger): stop triggerDraftEmit from recursing into itself\n\nThe earlier replace_all that converted every \\$emit(''update:draft'', this.messages)\nto this.triggerDraftEmit() also rewrote the helper''s own body, so the\ndebounced callback called this.triggerDraftEmit() instead of \\$emit. That\njust reset the same debounce — the update:draft event was never delivered,\nthe parent AutoModelingDialog never received messages, and acebase only\nheld the initial empty draft array written by saveProject. Drafts looked\nlike they did not load because they had never actually been saved.\n\nRestore the helper to \\$emit the messages inside the debounced callback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1459ef97fcc7ec60a56a02131dec501464c0c29d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/1459ef97fcc7ec60a56a02131dec501464c0c29d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDY0ZTE5YWQ2NGU5NmEzMjNmMTRjNjQ0OTdlOTlkMjVlNTgyYTZlNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3","sha":"36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3"}],"sha":"64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/64e19ad64e96a323f14c64497e99d25e582a6e52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T05:16:26Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T05:16:34Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(validation): swallow stop() rejection and guard late watcher updates\n\nTwo regressions surfaced from the earlier stop() implementation:\n\n1) \"Uncaught (in promise) Generation stopped by user\"\n   RecursiveRequirementsValidationGeneratorLangGraph.stop() rejected\n   both chunkReject and rejectCurrentProcess. The chunkReject rejection\n   already bubbles up to processNextChunk''s catch which then calls\n   rejectCurrentProcess — so the outer promise was double-rejected, and\n   the caller (ESDialoger.validateRequirements line 3262) invokes\n   validateRecursively() without .catch, so the rejection landed in the\n   browser as uncaught.\n\n   - stop() no longer touches rejectCurrentProcess directly.\n   - processNextChunk''s catch, when isStopped is set, RESOLVES the outer\n     promise with the accumulated results instead of rejecting — a user\n     cancel is a normal terminator, not an error.\n   - validateRecursively call sites in ESDialoger get a defensive\n     .catch as a safety net for any future failure path.\n\n2) \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''uniqueId'')\"\n   ESDialoger.stop() removes the processAnalysis message via splice,\n   but RequirementsValidatorLangGraphProxy.watchJob keeps its acebase\n   listeners alive (this proxy is not on LangGraphProxyBase so the\n   earlier tier-1 cleanup did not cover it). Late update events fired\n   onModelCreated which did messages.find(...).uniqueId on an already-\n   removed message.\n\n   - RecursiveRequirementsValidationGeneratorLangGraph._handleUpdate\n     now bails when isStopped (same guard already on _handleChunkComplete).\n   - ESDialoger.onModelCreated null-guards the messages.find lookup and\n     bails when this.isStopped is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e83101cad6d23ae28fd8068c0d172e4283cbe4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/2e83101cad6d23ae28fd8068c0d172e4283cbe4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDM2YmJjMDhkOTBhZTcwOWFjMDY0ZWM4NmUxYjY5MTM4NjNmZjQxZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4","sha":"61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4"}],"sha":"36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/36bbc08d90ae709ac064ec86e1b6913863ff41e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:51:07Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:51:15Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"perf(acebase): trim watcher leaks, write churn, and double scrollbar\n\nAudit identified hotspots that keep acebase listeners alive past job end\nand write the same node many times per drag/chunk/emit. Fixes:\n\nWatcher leaks\n- ModelCanvas.releaseQueue() ignored its argument when caller passed\n  none, so the queue watch_added on db://definitions/{id}/queue was\n  never torn down on canvas destroy. Default to current canvas id.\n- ModelCanvas.onEventHandler() called STORAGE.watch() without first\n  detaching prior listeners; on re-entry (model switch, version change)\n  the same callback ran N times.\n- LangGraphProxyBase.watchJob() leaked 6 inner watchers per job\n  (waitingJobCount, isFailed, isCompleted, totalProgress, currentProgress,\n  logs). Tracks every path on jobState._watchedPaths and runs\n  watch_off in bulk after onComplete fires and after onFailed\n  completes. EsValueLangGraphStudioProxy''s elements/relations watchers\n  hook into the same tracker via _trackWatchedPath.\n\nWrite churn\n- ModelCanvas.handleMouseMove used a 30-event counter to throttle\n  putObject(eventHandler/{email}); rate fluctuated with mousemove\n  frequency. Switched to a 150ms time-based throttle with trailing edge\n  so write rate stays capped at ~6/s during fast drags.\n- AutoModelingDialog.updateModelList rewrote the entire eventStorming\n  object for one modelList entry. Now writes only the modelList\n  subtree path so the rest of the tree is not re-serialized per add.\n- AutoModelingDialog.backupProject is wired to many child @change\n  events; debounce 800ms and flush on beforeRouteLeave/beforeDestroy/\n  beforeUnload alongside the existing draft flush.\n- ESDialoger emitted update:draft from 11 trace/preview/finalize\n  sites; each emit serialized the full messages tree. Introduce\n  triggerDraftEmit() which trailing-debounces 300ms, replacing every\n  direct emit.\n\nUX\n- Opengraph.vue .canvas-wrapper used overflow:scroll which always shows\n  both scrollbars regardless of content size, producing the \"double\n  scrollbar\" appearance with the outer page scroll. Switch to\n  overflow:auto so scrollbars appear only when content exceeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b6e1fd3d687dcf4e6123560913abea13431257c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/4b6e1fd3d687dcf4e6123560913abea13431257c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDYxODc3Yjc5MjhkY2JjYzY0ZWRmOWIzMzc4NmMxYTkxMmNjMWZjYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab","sha":"a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab"}],"sha":"61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/61877b7928dcbcc64edf9b33786c1a912cc1fcc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:31:10Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:33:06Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(automodeling): debounce draft autosave to avoid acebase write flood\n\nupdateDraft fires on every chunk-validation / summary / mapping update,\nwhich made writeDraft hammer the same db://definitions/{id}/draft node\nmany times per second. acebase logs \"Node is being overwritten\" and the\nws connection eventually times out under load.\n\nCoalesces writes with a 800ms lodash debounce that keeps only the latest\nmessages payload. beforeRouteLeave, beforeDestroy, and beforeUnload\nflush any pending write so the last edit is not lost when the user\nnavigates away.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9bd52ebfd02dc0110b221ec8920aec782c847ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/f9bd52ebfd02dc0110b221ec8920aec782c847ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGEzZGFkNGMyMGRiNzRhZWU5NmQyNThhZmZkZTI0OTFhNTZmNzJkYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e","sha":"1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e"}],"sha":"a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/a3dad4c20db74aee96d258affde2491a56f72dab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:17:45Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:17:57Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(storage): retry transient DB failures + throttle repeated error logs\n\nTwo production symptoms during brief acebase disconnects:\n  - stop() writes the isRemoveRequested flag once via setObject; if that\n    single write hits the disconnect window, the backend never sees the\n    cancel signal and keeps burning LLM calls;\n  - on job completion, proxies read state/outputs once via getObject; a\n    transient failure drops the result and the FE shows an empty screen\n    even though the backend finished successfully;\n  - watchers re-fire with stale paths while disconnected, so getObject\n    fails on every fire and floods the console with the same log.\n\nAdds three helpers on StorageBaseAbstract:\n  - getObjectWithRetry(path, opts): exponential backoff (default 6\n    attempts, 400ms→4s);\n  - setObjectWithRetry(path, obj, opts): same, returns false on final\n    failure;\n  - _logStorageError(path, error): per-path throttled console log (first\n    occurrence immediately, then once every 5s with cumulative count),\n    keyed off $root so it persists across watch fires.\n\nSwitches removeJob writes (Summarizer / Validator / SiteMap /\nCommandReadModel / RequirementsMapping / BoundedContext / UserStory) to\nsetObjectWithRetry, and the post-completion outputs reads in\nAggregateDraft / BoundedContext / RequirementsMapping proxies to\ngetObjectWithRetry. Behavior under stable connections is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"914e10c279adf8fa17e37305d947e5aed5a5d64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/914e10c279adf8fa17e37305d947e5aed5a5d64c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDFjZWIwZDkwNThmY2QxOTIxYjE4MjQ5MjQzY2E4MWI2ZDQ1N2FjMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc","sha":"2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc"}],"sha":"1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/1ceb0d9058fcd1921b18249243ca81b6d457ac0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T02:41:15Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T02:41:24Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(stop): cancel in-flight LangGraph jobs and unblock awaits on user stop\n\nstop() was a no-op or partially-implemented on most LangGraph generators,\nso clicking Stop left backend jobs running and the FE Promise still\nawaiting — the user saw the spinner keep going until completion.\n\nAdds removeJob(jobId) on all proxies (Summarizer, Validator, SiteMap,\nCommandReadModel, RequirementsMapping) which writes isRemoveRequested\ninto jobStates for the backend decentralized_job_manager to pick up and\nsafely cancel the in-progress job.\n\nImplements stop() on every generator that drives those proxies:\n- RecursiveRequirementsSummarizerLangGraph: tracks all active chunk\n  jobs, removes each on the backend and rejects each Promise so\n  Promise.all in the worker loop fail-fasts; iteration loop checks\n  isStopped before entering the next pass.\n- RecursiveRequirementsValidationGeneratorLangGraph: rejects chunkReject,\n  rejectCurrentProcess, calls proxy removeJob; processNextChunk and\n  _handleChunkComplete guard on isStopped so late-arriving completions\n  do not flash unstitched results onto the screen.\n- RequirementsValidationGeneratorLangGraph, DevideBoundedContextGenerator-\n  LangGraph, CommandReadModelExtractorLangGraph, RecursiveCommand-\n  ReadModelExtractorLangGraph, SiteMapGeneratorLangGraph, RecursiveSiteMap-\n  GeneratorLangGraph, RequirementsMappingGeneratorLangGraph: parallel\n  pattern - removeJob backend + reject local promise + guard onUpdate/\n  onComplete callbacks on isStopped.\n\nESDialoger.stop() now:\n- guards generator.stop() so a missing impl no longer throws and aborts\n  the rest of the cleanup;\n- treats the *LangGraph variants the same as their classic counterparts\n  for message cleanup (boundedContextResult, processAnalysis);\n- resets summarizeProgress and clears pendingBCGeneration when a\n  Summarizer is cancelled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73411c1c8747d0ddf77de11d8dd35e392e1bec62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/73411c1c8747d0ddf77de11d8dd35e392e1bec62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDJhZjc5ZDdmZWQ5YWM3OGM2NGE0YzdlM2E3MjJhZDk0OWEyMjBiY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381","sha":"c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381"}],"sha":"2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/2af79d7fed9ac78c64a4c7e3a722ad949a220bcc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T02:03:51Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T02:04:01Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"feat(progress): show chunk-level summarization progress and stitching status\n\nSurfaces backend chunk progress to the user while long-running requirement\nprocessing is in flight, so the UI does not appear hung between phases.\n\n- RecursiveRequirementsSummarizerLangGraph emits per-chunk progress\n  ({iteration, maxIterations, completedChunks, totalChunks}) via\n  client.updateSummarizeProgress; called once at iteration start and\n  after each chunk completes.\n- ESDialoger wires the callback into the bcGenerationOption message and\n  exposes summarizeProgress as a prop. BCGenerationOption replaces the\n  indeterminate spinner with a determinate one + \"Nth pass (X/Y chunks)\"\n  label whenever progress is available.\n- After the final validation chunk, hold isAnalizing=true and set\n  statusLabel=\"Connecting event flows...\" while EventFlowStitcher runs;\n  RequirementAnalysis renders statusLabel in place of the percent line.\n  Prevents the user from advancing on an unstitched (empty nextEvents)\n  intermediate result.\n- Adds ko/en locale strings for summarizingProgress and stitchingEvents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b62ee6ed9e747d9a5573878653c5315bf2cf2a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/b62ee6ed9e747d9a5573878653c5315bf2cf2a56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKGMzMDdlNDg1YWMxNjRkOGE1NzVkNzc4Zjg2YWUxM2E4NTdiMTgzODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca","sha":"23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca"}],"sha":"c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/c307e485ac164d8a575d778f86ae13a857b18381"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T01:17:09Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T01:17:20Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(validation): rebuild relations from stitched events and force redraw\n\nAfter multi-chunk processing, _createIncrementalElements (chunk 2+) skips\nbuilding relations, so the stitched nextEvents/level from the backend\nEventFlowStitcher need to be materialized into content.relations. Without\nthis, BPMN does not draw flow arrows even though stitching succeeds.\n\nAlso trigger one more onGenerationSucceeded after stitching so the\nRequirementAnalysis events watcher sees the final stitched payload — at\nend-of-chunks the regular per-chunk notify path does not fire again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5b6a24c8ca2328e3c3ff8a05ac3c034c0da7d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/f5b6a24c8ca2328e3c3ff8a05ac3c034c0da7d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDIzYTgzY2RiZmE0OWE2ZjdkZTc3NTBiOWQ4NzQwM2VkMmVkMjVhY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735","sha":"38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735"}],"sha":"23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/23a83cdbfa49a6f7de7750b9d87403ed2ed25aca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T08:09:45Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T08:09:54Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(validation): stitch event flow across chunks after recursive processing\n\nWhen requirements span multiple chunks the per-chunk LLM never sees the\nglobal picture, so events extracted from later chunks rarely link back\nto events from earlier chunks (nextEvents stays empty). End result: the\nanalysis view shows correct events/actors but no flow between them.\n\nAfter all chunks finish, when chunks.length > 1, hand the accumulated\nevents+actors+original text to a new EventFlowStitcher backend job\n(via RequirementsFlowStitcherLangGraphProxy) and merge only nextEvents\nand level back onto the existing events by name. Visual position info\nin content.elements is preserved.\n\n- New proxy: RequirementsFlowStitcherLangGraphProxy with makeNewJob /\n  watchJob and Firebase data restoration. watchJob fires onComplete on\n  the first of (content+isCompleted) arriving (whichever lands later)\n  and onFailed on isFailed.\n- Stitching is best-effort: failures log and return the unstitched\n  result so the user still sees events/actors.\n- Result is reassigned with a fresh reference (preserves the immutable\n  accumulator contract introduced earlier so Vue reactivity wakes).\n- 240s outer timeout in case the backend job hangs past its own 180s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24b73ecdc4385e39b2ad87a402801f16931b8346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/24b73ecdc4385e39b2ad87a402801f16931b8346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDM4Y2E0Yjc1YTk5NDFhZjE4N2EyZjhkOTdkZjgxNDI2OGE1MzQ3MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877","sha":"8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877"}],"sha":"38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ca4b75a9941af187a2f8d97df814268a534735"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:50:21Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:50:30Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(codegen): single-flight 401 alert via Gitea axios interceptor\n\nCode generation walks the template/topping tree and issues blob/tree\nfetches per file — dozens to hundreds of Gitea API calls. When the\nsession expires every call returns 401 and previously every catch\neither alerted or got silenced, producing alert storms or hangs.\n\nFunnel all Gitea 401s through one path:\n\n- Gitea: install a response interceptor on the axios client that\n  dispatches a window ''gitea-401'' CustomEvent on 401 (and still\n  rejects the original promise so per-call catches keep working).\n\n- CodeGenerator: listen to ''gitea-401'' in mounted, route to\n  alertReLogin, and make alertReLogin idempotent (reloginNotified\n  flag). The flag resets when showLoginCard closes so a follow-up\n  expiry can alert again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7409ee6f41f0dd2c58ffbfbff4f8b7109ba0853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/f7409ee6f41f0dd2c58ffbfbff4f8b7109ba0853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDg2NDZiZDM4ZWJjZTUzN2JiMjljOTZmOGUxOGIwYjhhNzc4ZDE4Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243","sha":"26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243"}],"sha":"8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/8646bd38ebce537bb29c96f8e18b0b8a778d1877"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:38:05Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:38:14Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(summarizer,validation): call parseState on isCompleted and accumulate immutably\n\nSummarizerLangGraphProxy:\n- Restore parseState() call in the isCompleted watcher. The backend\n  writes outputs in three steps (set_data without isCompleted →\n  sleep 0.1s → update_data({isCompleted: True})), so by the time\n  _watchSummaries fires parseState the local isCompleted is still\n  false and only onUpdate runs. Without re-calling parseState from\n  the isCompleted watcher onComplete never fires and the recursive\n  driver''s chunk Promise hangs.\n\nRecursiveRequirementsValidationGeneratorLangGraph:\n- Rewrite _accumulateResults for chunks >= 1 to produce fresh\n  top-level / content / analysisResult / events / actors references\n  instead of mutating in place. Vue prop comparison was seeing the\n  same reference on each chunk and not waking RequirementAnalysis''s\n  watcher, so only chunk 0 rendered until the final chunk happened\n  to change another prop by coincidence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22bdd5c97656b586b7673be1d9c93368fdce9553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/22bdd5c97656b586b7673be1d9c93368fdce9553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDI2Y2I3OTdkMzkxZTdlNmM3MTY2MmU1MjNiMGJkNThkYmM4OWQyNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43","sha":"38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43"}],"sha":"26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/26cb797d391e7e6c71662e523b0bd58dbc89d243"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:12:29Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:12:38Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(noise): swallow NavigationDuplicated, guard textarea ref, resolve translate failures\n\n- AutoModelingDialog.saveProject / ModelCanvas.saveModel·forkModel /\n  ProjectModel.close: vue-router 3 throws NavigationDuplicated when\n  pushing the current route. Skip push if path matches, and swallow the\n  duplicated error on the resulting promise.\n\n- AutoModelingDialog projectInfo.prompt watcher: $refs.textarea can be\n  undefined when the chat UI is closed or the dialog is destroying.\n  Guard before reading $el.\n\n- AggregateDefinitionPanel.getTranslate: detect/translate failures\n  (e.g., 403 from missing/invalid VUE_APP_TRANSLATE_KEY) left the\n  Promise pending forever because resolve only fired inside the success\n  branch. Always resolve — falling back to the pascalCase''d original on\n  any error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc600546cf15203f298981679ae2e5f4d8ec8fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/bc600546cf15203f298981679ae2e5f4d8ec8fb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDM4ZWMyNmY5ZTJlOTA1NDAyMzVmN2EyZjllMTYyM2ZkZDZhNjBhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b","sha":"9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b"}],"sha":"38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/38ec26f9e2e90540235f7a2f9e1623fdd6a60a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:00:09Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:00:23Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(posco): prefix project information path in ProjectModel auto-save flow\n\nloadLocalProject was seeding information.projectId with the raw uuid from\nthe route, which then flowed into AutoModelingDialog''s child-driven\nauto-save methods (updateUserStory / updateInputDDL / updateProjectInfo)\nand wrote db://definitions/<bareUuid>/information — bypassing the\n${providerUid}_project_<uuid> convention and breaking Mine/Public\nindexing for projects created via header → 만들기 → 프로젝트 생성.\n\n- loadLocalProject: prefix information.projectId with\n  ${providerUid}_project_ when seeding the local-only project (kept\n  me.projectId on the bare route value so loadProject''s draft read path\n  still composes the same single-prefix key).\n- saveProject: resolve providerUid (with localStorage fallback), prefix\n  storageCondition.projectId before writing, and emit the canonical\n  /${providerUid}/${type}/${rawId} router path on rename.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26e66922f7a3c8c075a5b0220547bbce0b62abe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/26e66922f7a3c8c075a5b0220547bbce0b62abe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b","node_id":"C_kwDOKntJ1NoAKDlmYjAzZmZiNTAxYTRlY2MzYWYyOTA5NmZkZGM1NzA1MjU4ZmQ1OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/msa-ez/platform/commit/f1f1ae4ce142cc831347329706c3d49967289579","sha":"f1f1ae4ce142cc831347329706c3d49967289579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/f1f1ae4ce142cc831347329706c3d49967289579"}],"sha":"9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/9fb03ffb501a4ecc3af29096fddc5705258fd58b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/f1f1ae4ce142cc831347329706c3d49967289579/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:28:09Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:29:16Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(summarizer): parallel chunk jobs and harden proxy callbacks\n\nRecursiveRequirementsSummarizerLangGraph:\n- Switch from serial chunk loop to bounded-concurrency parallel workers\n  (chunkConcurrency=3) via _processChunksParallel + _runChunkJob.\n- Preserve chunk order by index so line refs stay intact.\n- Add no-progress guard (noProgressRatio=0.95) to stop iterating when\n  consolidation has converged; remove extra post-loop final pass.\n\nSummarizerLangGraphProxy:\n- Wrap parseState() in isFailed watcher with try/catch so a TypeError\n  from a null onUpdate (recursive iter 2+) can''t block onFailed and\n  hang the chunk Promise forever.\n- Guard onComplete/onUpdate/onFailed with typeof === ''function'' checks.\n- Add explicit isFailed branch in _parseAndNotifyJobState that skips\n  onUpdate; failure is delivered solely via onFailed watcher.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06d71d71847de18b6001173390f98118ce5eb8b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/06d71d71847de18b6001173390f98118ce5eb8b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/f1f1ae4ce142cc831347329706c3d49967289579","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/foll