api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/commits/fb01c0fabb1cab83d551bbed13e374e1fc9d13f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:17:27Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:29:16Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"fix(posco): guard providerUid in saves and restrict onprem Public tab to shared index\n\n- AutoModelingDialog.saveProject / ModelCanvas.saveModel·forkModel·\n  validateStorageCondition: resolve providerUid via me.userInfo.providerUid\n  with localStorage fallback, abort save when missing. Prevents bare-uuid\n  paths created by auto-save when userInfo hasn''t hydrated yet.\n- AlgoliaModelLists onprem Public tab: read from\n  userLists/everyone/share_first (or share_<type>) instead of scanning all\n  db://definitions, so non-shared projects no longer leak into Public.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fe93926122b779bcf5ce8daa73f2e04b6eb9b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/trees/4fe93926122b779bcf5ce8daa73f2e04b6eb9b31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/msa-ez/platform/git/commits/fb01c0fabb1cab83d551bbed13e374e1fc9d13f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.