tps://api.github.com/users/vodis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vodis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vodis/cs_ng_app_client/commits/8a2b17bd26a62aaf3ce9e9d6d7b0d25c27a0381e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:10:01Z","email":"i40217891@gmail.com","name":"Dmytro Voitenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:10:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(auth): align login flow, wallet onboarding, and session redirects (#143)\n\n* feat(auth): align login flow, wallet onboarding, and session redirects\n\nRoute unauthenticated users to /login, extract first-time wallet setup to\n/generate-wallet, and always show passkey/social options on login with a\nprofile-first error when passkey is not enabled. Centralize auth-shell routes\nin layout and remove the redundant index.html pre-bootstrap hack.\n\n* fix(auth): distinguish passkey linked from passkey login availability\n\nProfile and login were treating linked passkeys as sign-in ready even when\npasskeyLoginEnabled is false. Show linked-only state in profile, disable\npasskey on login with an upfront note, and map provider capability errors\nseparately from account-setup errors.\n\n* fix(ci): extract profile styles to fix production component budget failure\n\n* fix(auth): protect home route with AuthGuard after logout\n\nRedirect unauthenticated users from `/` to `/login?returnUrl=/` so the exchange page is no longer reachable without a valid session.\n\n* fix(auth): filter login social methods\n\n* fix(ci): mock authenticated shell e2e session\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vodis-bot <vodis-bot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab44a168fe358e621d26f41af4b939d0e2e234dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vodis/cs_ng_app_client/git/trees/ab44a168fe358e621d26f41af4b939d0e2e234dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vodis/cs_ng_app_client/git/commits/8a2b17bd26a62aaf3ce9e9d6d7b0d25c27a0381e","verification":{"payload":"tree ab44a168fe358e621d26f41af4b939d0e2e234dc\nparent 0b1e1cb8533d920ff6a06839c65c70625b7e70f6\nauthor Dmytro Voitenko <i40217891@gmail.com> 1784157001 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784157001 +0100\n\nfeat(auth): align login flow, wallet onboarding, and session redirects (#143)\n\n* feat(auth): align login flow, wallet onboarding, and session redirects\n\nRoute unauthenticated users to /login, extract first-time wallet setup to\n/generate-wallet, and always show passkey/social options on login with a\nprofile-first error when passkey is not enabled. Centralize auth-shell routes\nin layout and remove the redundant index.html pre-bootstrap hack.\n\n* fix(auth): distinguish passkey linked from passkey login availability\n\nProfile and login were treating linked passkeys as sign-in ready even when\npasskeyLoginEnabled is false. Show linked-only state in profile, disable\npasskey on login with an upfront note, and map provider capability errors\nseparately from account-setup errors.\n\n* fix(ci): extract profile styles to fix production component budget failure\n\n* fix(auth): protect home route with AuthGuard after logout\n\nRedirect unauthenticated users from `/` to `/login?returnUrl=/` so the exchange page is no longer reachable without a valid session.\n\n* fix(auth): filter login social methods\n\n* fix(ci): mock authenticated shell e2e session\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vodis-bot <vodis-bot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWBNJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhwYQAAuxEG8G2x/eHNpo+PNCbXu6\nJD6jb6azfOg70l8xH2kPngsCn/sSiwiq1/aLPcv54va+BEC1y7Gq6m9eDHjzcbnF\nXugkGG7cvJB0zao+jpM3yHgidxj5g09sLCDpJR2DdWP9SpKTweOBH+P0vQ+GU+So\nWWUQQvPJOdfbOhJoSvBnFhT/F/sLd0wUr7UOLvZZ6lOBzu/gh76DmaXN0kwM36W5\nOmg33MSuNyQfkkuefn5/DhqDtxJIwQ5fSMSe+uGkrrshCPKhdbDYGyZ52Jxd+OLo\nHyRASDwe3S2JmPRkEM+k4BoxZltwX9ymMbFBvETNQZI8gEHTzryYmcfbWHHP3xT5\nd02P1bb6Fsp/ph8CZBtogIAqUetO77rNrI/+wRUf