rivy/external wallets, including refresh, active-wallet selection, and removal.\n- Add cached balance display backed by the backend `/api/v1/balances` contract.\n\n## Scope\n- Frontend only. The client consumes backend-provided auth, wallet, and balance APIs.\n- No Privy secrets, RPC credentials, or authoritative token/balance registry are exposed in the browser.\n\n## Included PRs\n- #102 `feat(auth): bootstrap Privy runtime bridge`\n- #103 `feat(auth): add login and profile shell`\n- #104 `feat(auth): add wallet management UI`\n- #105 `feat(auth): show cached balances`","tree":{"sha":"be34de426161d5efe04161b9c8b57b3c00949330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vodis/cs_ng_app_client/git/trees/be34de426161d5efe04161b9c8b57b3c00949330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vodis/cs_ng_app_client/git/commits/5f9e178f6907017b2e1e52037df3ce11b93c60e5","verification":{"payload":"tree be34de426161d5efe04161b9c8b57b3c00949330\nparent c0e0cd43c7e4821d26bd72d8894068b55a608722\nparent d794e308c35c99bd5792802937e73d4ac41ad786\nauthor Dmytro Voitenko <i40217891@gmail.com> 1782223322 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782223322 +0100\n\nrelease: Angular Privy onboarding, wallets, and balances\n\n## Summary\n- Release the Angular Privy onboarding flow: runtime Privy bridge bootstrap, login/profile shell, route guarding, and authenticated session refresh.\n- Add wallet management UI for linked Privy/external wallets, including refresh, active-wallet selection, and removal.\n- Add cached balance display backed by the backend `/api/v1/balances` contract.\n\n## Scope\n- Frontend only. The client consumes backend-provided auth, wallet, and balance APIs.\n- No Privy secrets, RPC credentials, or authoritative token/balance registry are exposed in the browser.\n\n## Included PRs\n- #102 `feat(auth): bootstrap Privy runtime bridge`\n- #103 `feat(auth): add login and profile shell`\n- #104 `feat(auth): add wallet management UI`\n- #105 `feat(auth): show cached balances`","reaso