e":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/commits/4c5ecd34cb6ba316a41b628d4972d5ec5ba1d6c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:41:18Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:41:18Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"message":"Add distributed data engineering notes (Spark, Kafka, Airflow, BigQuery, Modelling, SQL, System Design)\n\nNew files:\n- data engineering/spark.md: PySpark DataFrames, transformations, window functions, joins, broadcast, caching, performance tuning\n- data engineering/kafka.md: Topics, partitions, offsets, consumer groups, Python kafka-python client, GCP Pub/Sub, DLQ/fan-out/event-sourcing patterns\n- data engineering/airflow.md: DAGs, operators, sensors, XComs, trigger rules, backfill, Variables/Connections, best practices\n- data engineering/bigquery.md: Columnar architecture, partitioning, clustering, advanced SQL (ARRAY, UNNEST, recursive CTE), loading/export patterns\n- data engineering/data_modelling.md: Star schema, fact/dimension tables, SCD Type 1/2/3, medallion architecture, Data Vault, surrogate keys\n- data engineering/sql.md: Window functions, CTEs, complex aggregations, consecutive days, session gaps, deduplication, data quality checks in SQL\n- data engineering/system_design.md: Batch vs streaming, Lambda/Kappa, circuit breaker, backpressure, DLQ, idempotency, storage trade-offs\n\nUpdated:\n- data engineering/data_engineer.md: expanded overview table, added Data Engineering Patterns section (aggregation, deduplication, pipeline class), Distributed & Cloud Stack index table\n- README.md: expanded Data Engineering section with direct links to all 7 new files\n\nAudit: 76 total files, 74 reachable, 0 orphans (2 .github config), 0 broken links\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0e3a657840a6231e36c0ee4598f5f497c9e0e78","url":"https://api.github.com/