er":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:17:36Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"message":"refactor(react): merge duplicates into opinion files, add cross-references in React.md\n\n- React_State.md: added Pure Components/StrictMode, Immutable Update Patterns\n  (flat objects, nested objects, arrays, arrays-of-objects), Immer library\n  (useImmer + useImmerReducer), Multi-Context pattern, Custom Provider pattern,\n  notes on Context, Zustand selectors/useShallow, Zustand DevTools\n\n- React_HTTP.md: added Service Layer pattern (api-client.ts + UserService class),\n  Generic HttpService class (one class for any entity type), custom useUsers hook\n\n- React_Routing.md: added React Router DOM hooks (useLocation, useNavigate,\n  useParams, useSearchParams with gotchas, useRouteError), full production\n  app setup (createBrowserRouter + TanStack Query + Chakra UI in main.tsx)\n\n- React_Forms.md: added useState vs useRef comparison table + examples,\n  Formik section with Yup validation + Formik vs RHF comparison table\n\n- React.md: replaced 5 large duplicate sections (~4630 lines) with concise\n  cross-reference stubs pointing to dedicated opinion files:\n  * Lines 1375-1913 → stub → React_State.md\n  * Lines 3359-4217 → stub → React_Forms.md + React_FormValidation.md\n  * Lines 4218-6125 → stub → React_HTTP.md\n  * Lines 6126-6993 → stub → React_State.md (global state, Zustand)\n  * Lines 6994-7454 → stub → React_Routing.md\n\nNo content loss — all unique material moved to dedicated files.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"47bb7b7f2ed42940859c5ae2c48df211222387fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/47bb7b7f2ed42940859c5ae2c48df211222387fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/commits/c4f241048f4413c4ac75a6d6042c404d8a530e5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://