e imports via @ path alias (Vite + tsconfig, Next.js built-in)\n  - Code maintainability rules (one component per file, barrel exports, no prop drilling)\n  - TypeScript strict mode settings\n\nReorganization moves:\n- JSX + TSX moved from end-of-file → right after React Components (basics group)\n- Custom Hooks moved from after Error Boundaries → immediately after Hooks in React\n- React 18+ Features moved → after Advanced Patterns\n- Error Boundaries moved → after React 18+ Features\n- Optimization moved → after Error Boundaries (performance comes after robustness)\n- Table of Contents fully regenerated to match new order\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a558b75cd25d0c54c9d0a473b006ec9fe5d90a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/a558b75cd25d0c54c9d0a473b006ec9fe5d90a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/commits/0b6a99ca70e540c34eae6e49b5ab7e92f28fb8c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41226521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YashNarK","id":41226521,"login":"YashNarK","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjI2NTIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK","use