ve Getters/Setters, Classes (ES6+ detailed), Object Methods ES6+ into OOP\n- Move Error Handling Patterns next to Exception Handling\n- Move Promises and Async/Await next to Callbacks section\n- Move Iterating Collections and Copying Objects next to WeakMap/WeakSet\n- Move Important Resources to end of document\n- Add missing ## headers for Callbacks and Browser APIs sections\n- Regenerate full Table of Contents\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d49c5db12c484a31b0fa4572129deeb72ea2bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/8d49c5db12c484a31b0fa4572129deeb72ea2bfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/commits/1d281c52f43038939c852c24f8ae4565212e79b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41226521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YashNarK","id":41226521,"login":"YashNarK","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjI2NTIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YashNarK/notes/commit/1d281c52f43038939c852c24f8ae4565212e79b1","node_id":"C_kwDOKp0b29oAKDFkMjgxYzUyZjQzMDM4OTM5Yzg1MmMyNGY4YWU0NTY1MjEyZTc5YjE","parents":[{"htm