en heading hierarchy)\n- Fix Multiple catch blocks: JS only has ONE catch block; replace invalid\n  dual-catch syntax with instanceof pattern\n- Fix Promise .then() output order (End was shown before Async Task\n  despite being inside the .then() callback)\n- Fix myCircle.radius (getter doesn''t exist) -> myCircle._radius with\n  correct comment\n- Fix duplicate ''let removedElement'' variable declarations in array example\n\nContent improvements:\n- Add ?? (Nullish Coalescing) to Short Circuiting section with clear\n  comparison vs ||\n- Add for..in caveat in Loops section (don''t use on arrays)\n- Add Event Loop section: call stack, macro-task queue, microtask queue,\n  priority order, annotated examples, blocking-the-loop warning\n- Add JSON section: stringify/parse, options (replacer/reviver/indent),\n  what JSON cannot represent, safe serialization helper\n- Expand String Methods: trim, padStart/End, includes, startsWith,\n  endsWith, indexOf, slice, at(), replace, replaceAll, split, repeat\n- Fix Static Members awkward mid-sentence line break\n- Update TOC: add all ~50 missing sections including ES6+ reference,\n  Browser APIs, Event Loop, JSON, Iterating Collections, Type Checking\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5790344a9cb237b3b36cd5c7bcf87fa2f910721a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/5790344a9cb237b3b36cd5c7bcf87fa2f910721a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/commits/8b64d2951fac1f7528d9557ae834bad6259de9e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41226521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/g