YashNarK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/commits/aaf2df64087bb424888be2e99e1024c403d261c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T05:39:16Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T05:39:16Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"message":"docs(react): rearrange sections from basics to advanced\n\nMoved ''General Programming Concepts & Libraries'' (tool listings,\nlibrary references, JSX/TSX overview, deployment guide) from the top\nof the document to the END as an appendix/reference section.\n\nNew reading order (basics → advanced):\n1. Prerequisites (JS + TS links)\n2. Setup Local Environment\n3. JavaScript Concepts (ES6+ for React)\n4. React Basics (components, props, JSX)\n5. State & State in React\n6. Props vs State\n7. Hooks in React (useState, useEffect, useContext, useReducer, etc.)\n8. Event Handling\n9. React Event Pooling\n10. Life Cycle of a React Component\n11. Unidirectional Data Flow\n12. Memoizing\n13. React Form & Form Validation\n14. Connecting to a Backend\n15. TanStack Query\n16. React Query DevTools\n17. Global State Management (Context, Reducer)\n18. Context vs Redux\n19. Zustand\n20. Routing (types + React Router DOM)\n21. Optimization in React\n22. React 18+ Features\n23. Error Boundaries\n24. Custom Hooks\n25. Advanced Patterns\n26. React Server Components (RSC)\n27. Testing React\n28. [Appendix] General Programming Concepts & Libraries\n\nTable of Contents updated to match the new section order.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab1e26e7a06e5b830c267e6dadff2c05b5ea7720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/ab1e26e7a06e5b830c267e6dadff2c05b5ea7720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/commits/aaf2df64087bb424888be2e99e1024c403d261c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ver