YashNarK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashNarK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/commits/f37ee865c9ed8981b6d1a3db9e71872ae7a0afd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T05:13:41Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T05:13:41Z","email":"narenkrithick@gmail.com","name":"YashNarK"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive TypeScript language notes\n\n18-section exhaustive TypeScript guide covering:\n- Basic types, primitives, special types (any/unknown/never)\n- Functions: overloads, callbacks, rest/optional parameters\n- Interfaces vs type aliases, declaration merging\n- Enums: numeric, string, and const enums\n- Generics: functions, interfaces, classes, constraints, keyof/typeof\n- Classes: access modifiers, abstract classes, static members\n- Type narrowing: typeof/instanceof/in/discriminated unions\n- User-defined type guards and exhaustiveness checking\n- All built-in utility types (Partial, Pick, Omit, Record, etc.)\n- Advanced types: mapped types, conditional types, infer keyword\n- Modules, declaration files (.d.ts), ambient declarations\n- Decorators: class, method, and decorator factories\n- TypeScript with React (TSX): props, events, hooks, generics\n- Error handling: unknown in catch, Result pattern\n- tsconfig deep dive: strict mode flags, path aliases\n- Best practices and common pitfalls\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"647041287cc989321fbf245d2797247ec8fab0c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YashNarK/notes/git/trees/647041287cc989321fbf245d279724