/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/meroppfolging-backend/commits/4d1d4428da9c34c5656393ac8cefacd53d0b0e15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T12:00:53Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T12:00:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump org.springframework.boot from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2 (#317)\n\n* Bump org.springframework.boot from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2\n\nBumps [org.springframework.boot](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot) from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/compare/v3.5.9...v4.0.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: org.springframework.boot\n  dependency-version: 4.0.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* Replace removed function fromHttlUrl\n\n* Remove nullability\n\n* Change kafka consumerfactory from <String,String?> to <String, Any>\n\n* Replace kafkaContainer through @ServiceConnection with spring-boot-starter-kafka-test\n\n* Fix error handling on fun person\n\n* Fix fixture for test.\n\n* Ktlint autoformat\n\n* Adding test of SykmeldingConsumer and handling of tombstone\n\n* Changing the ConsumerConfig to <String, String>\n\nThey were originally <String, String?> that Spring-kafka no longer allow.\n\nTried with <String, Any> as well, but prefer to avoid Any if we can\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Bjørn Faaberg <bjorn.faaberg@nav.no>","tree":{"sha":"c2ad2f22f6d58e5447be8767a7c193b1295c8efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/meroppfolging-backend/git/trees/c2ad2f22f6d58e5447be8767a7c193b1295c8efe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/meroppfolging-backend/git/commits/4d1d4428da9c34c5656393ac8cefacd53d0b0e15","verification":{"payload":"tree c2ad2f22f6d58e5447be8767a7c193b1295c8efe\nparent 4a53444cf0fd4b067d2bdf4d6ceb60ef155e8658\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1772020853 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772020853 +0000\n\nBump org.springframework.boot from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2 (#317)\n\n* Bump org.springframework.boot from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2\n\nBumps [org.springframework.boot](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot) from 3.5.9 to 4.0.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/compare/v3.5.9...v4.0.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: org.springframework.boot\n  dependency-version: 4.0.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* Replace removed function fromHttlUrl\n\n* Remove nullability\n\n* Change kafka consumerfactory from <String,String?> to <String, Any>\n\n* Replace kafkaContainer through @ServiceConnection with spring-boot-starter-kafka-test\n\n* Fix error handling on fun person\n\n* Fix fixture for test.\n\n* Ktlint autoformat\n\n* Adding test of SykmeldingConsumer and handling of tombstone\n\n* Changing the ConsumerConfig to <String, String>\n\nThey were originally <String, String?> that Spring-kafka no longer allow.\n\nTried with <String, Any> as well, but prefer to avoid Any if we can\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bo