itoryId":715657552,"sha":"00b6c8bd34ee9b34dec957134e95b450f9e23122"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"authoredDate":"2025-04-17T16:01:01Z","committedDate":"2025-04-17T16:01:01Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:14:40.831Z","repositoryId":715657552,"sha":"031b0fbf5cef2c8a0b42914568fd249c11d59dbc"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"authoredDate":"2025-04-08T19:01:34Z","committedDate":"2025-04-08T19:01:34Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:14:40.831Z","repositoryId":715657552,"sha":"341e86152ff2006d507d741e5d9130cd6959db60"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"authoredDate":"2025-04-08T18:39:40Z","committedDate":"2025-04-08T18:39:40Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:14:40.831Z","repositoryId":715657552,"sha":"ae3976694ec316dee680b5ae09f737e58f72214e"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"authoredDate":"2025-04-08T18:39:17Z","committedDate":"2025-04-08T18:39:17Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"HankunYu","providerType":"User"},"email":"KmcyD1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:14:40.831Z","repositoryId":715657552,"sha":"93f90d436b85ef94ab256c9b1cd97993a40814b6"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:14:40.831Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11606969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu","id":11606969,"login":"HankunYu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjA2OTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/eac835942d7ab3bd5ae7e4ab9867ae6a79b8b774/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:40:48Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:40:48Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"message":"Add local scrape state and season lookup to danmu plugin\n\nThe plugin had no memory of past scrapes: it re-asked dandanplay about\nevery file on every pass, and \"not in dandanplay\", \"listed but no danmu\nyet\" and \"never scraped\" were indistinguishable on disk because the\nepisode id was never stored.\n\nAdd a scrape state store that records three things per file, each with\nits own invalidation rule: the resolved episode id, the server-side\ndanmu count, and the config that produced the current .ass file.\n\nLook up a whole series in one request instead of asking per episode.\nAn empty result is an authoritative \"not carried\" for the entire show,\nand a non-empty one gives the full episode list, so every later file of\nthat show resolves with no request at all. Hash matching is now only a\nfallback. Season numbers are read from the media metadata, which lets\nthe episode offset be derived instead of configured by hand, and makes\nspecials and episode 0 addressable.\n\nReplace the \"give up after 10 retries\" cutoff with exponential backoff\nkeyed on the outcome and on how recent the content is. The cutoff both\ngave up while a new show was still accumulating danmu and was undone by\nthe next global scrape, which re-added the file and restarted the count.\n\nReport content dandanplay does not carry as a neutral state rather than\na scrape failure, so users are not led into repeated scrapes and manual\nmatches that cannot succeed, and summarise it once per directory.\n\nSkip hash matching entirely when ffmpeg is unavailable and say so once,\ninstead of hashing 16MB per file and sending a request that cannot match.","tree":{"sha":"eb2927f714c6a98cafa384cd1e7857a5b671e245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/eb2927f714c6a98cafa384cd1e7857a5b671e245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/eac835942d7ab3bd5ae7e4ab9867ae6a79b8b774","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11606969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu","id":11606969,"login":"HankunYu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjA2OTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/eac835942d7ab3bd5ae7e4ab9867ae6a79b8b774","node_id":"C_kwDOKqgRUNoAKGVhYzgzNTk0MmQ3YWIzYmQ1YWU3ZTRhYjk4NjdhZTZhNzliOGI3NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/c87b059a4613e4c668b5b5b84e914a063ad4560f","sha":"c87b059a4613e4c668b5b5b84e914a063ad4560f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/c87b059a4613e4c668b5b5b84e914a063ad4560f"}],"sha":"eac835942d7ab3bd5ae7e4ab9867ae6a79b8b774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/eac835942d7ab3bd5ae7e4ab9867ae6a79b8b774"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11606969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu","id":11606969,"login":"HankunYu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjA2OTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/c87b059a4613e4c668b5b5b84e914a063ad4560f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T09:05:07Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T09:05:07Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"message":"Add request throttling and fix silent episode mismatches in danmu plugin\n\nRoute all dandanplay calls through DanmuAPI._request with a shared\n30 req/min token bucket, connection reuse, and a process-wide 429/503\ngate. Throttling and undeterminable files no longer count as failures\nor enter the retry list, which previously turned every server-side\nblock into an extra retry.\n\nFix several cases where the plugin turned \"cannot determine\" into a\nconfidently wrong answer:\n- Episode numbers are now validated against the 0-8999 encoding range\n  instead of being clamped. Episode >= 10000 used to compose an id\n  belonging to a different anime, and episode 0 (a legitimate\n  pre-broadcast special) was silently rewritten to episode 1.\n- \"Only from Bilibili\" now prefers Bilibili and falls back to all\n  sources when there is not enough, instead of writing empty danmu\n  and retrying forever.\n- Directory manual matches now apply to .strm files, and no longer\n  hash 16MB plus spawn ffmpeg before being read.\n- .strm files without a TMDB id are reported as unresolvable rather\n  than occupying the retry list with zero possibility of success.\n\nAlso restrict the API endpoints to the configured scrape paths, stop\nbatch scraping on plugin shutdown, persist update_path, and fix\nsubtitle matching where Ep1 matched Ep10.","tree":{"sha":"e7a9719ce9249b8d24422647ded081d39e1d4db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/e7a9719ce9249b8d24422647ded081d39e1d4db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/c87b059a4613e4c668b5b5b84e914a063ad4560f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11606969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/f