t-Plugins/commits/cc473e790e4bae6d10a61f2c8cad6af729f81172/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:24:39Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:24:39Z","email":"kmcyd1@gmail.com","name":"HankunYu"},"message":"弹幕刮削 v1.8.0\n\n- 新增电影TMDB匹配支持，识别为电影时按电影类型查询，修复电影内容查不到弹幕\n- 重写字幕合并为反向合并：原字幕完整保留不再破坏特效（位置/大小/字号），\n  弹幕缩放进原字幕坐标系，blur仅作用于无特效的底部对白\n- 优化目录浏览加载速度：弹幕计数缓存、os.scandir、手动匹配负缓存，减少磁盘访问\n- 修复加载中误显示\"请先配置目录\"的问题，状态与目录并行加载\n- .gitignore 通配 node_modules","tree":{"sha":"22a291f8a903bfe121e696ed6abb56fb67fa2258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/22a291f8a903bfe121e696ed6abb56fb67fa2258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/cc473e790e4bae6d10a61f2c8cad6af729f81172","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11606969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu","id":11606969,"login":"HankunYu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjA2OTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HankunYu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HankunYu/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/cc473e790e4bae6d10a61f2c8cad6af729f81172","node_id":"C_kwDOKqgRUNo