ive): streamline dependency tracking and triggering logic\n\n- Simplified the track and trigger functions for improved clarity and performance.\n- Renamed variables for consistency and readability.\n- Removed redundant checks and streamlined the logic for managing dependencies.\n- Updated the reactive function to enhance its handling of object proxies.","tree":{"sha":"c778ea5f2b5f1bd3015145e41fc959533ec5004e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/trees/c778ea5f2b5f1bd3015145e41fc959533ec5004e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/commits/27c693679f521fb766171e943da8a414dc778b5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/27c693679f521fb766171e943da8a414dc778b5c","node_id":"C_kwDOKsLmtdoAKDI3YzY5MzY3OWY1MjFmYjc2NjE3MWU5NDNkYThhNDE0ZGM3NzhiNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/0866e05292a719c6b943ba5f09be213e88092f94","sha":"0866e05292a719c6b943ba5f09be213e88092f94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/0866e05292a719c6b943ba5f09be213e88092f94"}],"sha":"27c693679f521fb766171e943da8a414dc778b5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/27c693679f521fb766171e943da8a414dc778b5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/0866e05292a719c6b943ba5f09be213e88092f94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T12:15:25Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T12:15:25Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"message":"refactor(promise): replace setTimeout with queueMicrotask for callback execution\n\n- Updated MyPromise class to use queueMicrotask for executing callbacks, ensuring they run as microtasks instead of macrotasks.\n- This change improves the timing of promise r