rview/commit/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb","sha":"767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb"}],"sha":"783f5eb49edb49b135b973ed4926a97a6ed5bf4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/783f5eb49edb49b135b973ed4926a97a6ed5bf4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T08:23:21Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T08:23:21Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"message":"feat(reactive): 实现响应式系统核心功能\n\n添加 reactive、effect、track 和 trigger 函数，构建基础响应式能力\n- 使用 Proxy 实现对象属性的自动依赖追踪\n- 实现 effect 副作用函数，支持嵌套和清理\n- 添加完整的单元测试覆盖基础功能、嵌套响应式和分支切换","tree":{"sha":"f6b72eb9841e3b9d8e8e036dfcc96a1d2814d2dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/trees/f6b72eb9841e3b9d8e8e036dfcc96a1d2814d2dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/commits/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb","node_id":"C_kwDOKsLmtdoAKDc2N2EzYjI3NGM5NmYwNjM3MmViZmEwZDEyNjM4OTNkOTkyMWUxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e","sha":"2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e"}],"sha":"767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/767a3b274c96f06372ebfa0d1263893d9921e1eb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T16:31:16Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T16:31:16Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"message":"feat(promise): 实现静态方法 resolve、reject、all、race 和 allSettled\n\n添加 MyPromise 的静态方法以符合 Promise/A+ 规范，包括：\n- resolve：包装值或返回已有的 Promise\n- reject：创建已拒绝的 Promise\n- all：等待所有 Promise 完成或首个拒绝\n- race：响应首个完成或拒绝的 Promise\n- allSettled：等待所有 Promise 完成并返回状态结果\n\n同时更新测试文件以验证这些方法的正确性。","tree":{"sha":"19ab98957d132f55498b522aa8d974a9f6aae3c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/trees/19ab98957d132f55498b522aa8d974a9f6aae3c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/commits/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e","node_id":"C_kwDOKsLmtdoAKDJlZDMwNzE0Y2NmY2I5NjA5ZjBhMmE3ZjZlZjRhMmViM2E1ODk2MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75","sha":"91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75"}],"sha":"2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/2ed30714ccfcb9609f0a2a7f6ef4a2eb3a58960e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T15:56:18Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T15:56:18Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"message":"refactor(promise): 重构 Promise 实现为 ES6 类并完善功能\n\n重构 MyPromise 实现，从函数构造器改为 ES6 类语法\n修复状态名称拼写错误（fullfill → fulfilled）\n添加 Promise/A+ 规范的 resolvePromise 方法以支持 thenable 对象\n改进异步处理机制，确保回调函数始终异步执行\n添加循环引用检测和更多边界情况测试","tree":{"sha":"edc3fe7267964e9cb9cf2a7895afc8c431e20eef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/trees/edc3fe7267964e9cb9cf2a7895afc8c431e20eef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/commits/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75","node_id":"C_kwDOKsLmtdoAKDkxZmUyYmU3OGE1MDk1MjhhMmZlNTM3NzM4MzY4MTU4MDUzMjZhNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bigMeowCoding/interview/commit/8a83e57568a89a4d0cb2c4adae8e46d1f5e41f9f","sha":"8a83e57568a89a4d0cb2c4adae8e46d1f5e41f9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/8a83e57568a89a4d0cb2c4adae8e46d1f5e41f9f"}],"sha":"91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/91fe2be78a509528a2fe53773836815805326a75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/commits/8a83e57568a89a4d0cb2c4adae8e46d1f5e41f9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T14:05:19Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T14:05:19Z","email":"zhouyijun@chagee.com","name":"周义竣"},"message":"fix(debounce): 修复函数执行时丢失this上下文的问题\n\n修复debounce函数内部使用箭头函数导致this绑定错误的问题。通过保存外部this引用，确保回调函数能够正确使用调用时的上下文。\n\n同时移除测试文件中不再支持的额外功能测试，简化实现以专注于核心防抖逻辑。","tree":{"sha":"60666332b22c733279cdda6ec00964f0c5fd7327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/trees/60666332b22c733279cdda6ec00964f0c5fd7327"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigMeowCoding/interview/git/commits/8a83e57568a89a4d0cb2c4adae8e46d1f5e41f9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso